     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Thu, Feb 2, 2017 at 4:13 PM stcallen &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">steven....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
